 ket is child-friendly and a great experience for the whole family.\nThe ma
 rket is open from 13:00 to 18:00 hours. Mark the date in your calendar and
  show up to a great day of good bargains\, oddities and cool people.\nDark
  Market 2026 Copenhagen is created in collaboration with BIBLIOTEKET.\nRea
 d more about Dark Market on http://DarkMarket.dk/\nFREE ENTRANCE!
